Looks good. But notice tower positions for some are way off path, e.g. sniper at top center, super top right, etc. They still can shoot due range. Fine.

Interesting: after victory, start button "Meadow defended" and wave panel threat shows "BFB with escort" even though wave 50 cleared. `updateThreatPanel` displayRound = state.round (victory) =50, so shows wave 50 threat "BFB with escort". For victory state, maybe should show "No bloons detected" or "Meadow secured". The threat card still previews final wave, which is stale after clearing. Could improve: if phase victory, threat title "Meadow secured", sub "No bloons remain." and perhaps bloon icons hidden. Currently screenshot shows BFB with escort and wave 50. That's a polish bug. Similarly defeat phase shows current wave threat maybe okay. For victory, updateThreatPanel should special-case. Also nextWaveValue could show 50 instead of "—". Fine.

Let's fix updateThreatPanel for phase victory:
```
if (state.phase==='victory') {
 dom.nextWaveValue.textContent = pad(TOTAL_ROUNDS);
 dom.difficultyPill...
 dom.threatBloons.innerHTML='';
 dom.threatTitle.textContent='Meadow secured';
 dom.threatSub.textContent='Every last bloon has been popped.';
 dom.waveProgressBar width 100? updateUI handles.
 ui.threatKey=...
 return;
}
```
But difficulty "Finale" okay. Could set pill "Cleared" className? Use "Cleared" maybe with lime. There is no `is-cleared` class; can set className difficulty-pill (Calm). Better `difficultyPill.textContent = 'Cleared'`; className='difficulty-pill'. At freeplay after victory continue phase between shows wave 51. Fine.
For defeat:
```
if phase defeat: threatBloons empty? title 'The village is overrun'; sub 'Try a different tower mix and defend again.' Maybe.
