`color-mix` may not be supported in older browsers but modern fine. Could avoid for compatibility. Not critical but maybe Chrome supported. Fine.

Responsive adjustments:
- At max-width 860, map modal width maybe one column? 900 -> calc full; grid 2 cols might be too tight on phone. Add in existing media maybe at max-width 560: `.map-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}`, preview height 100. map-foot stack. Also sandbox bar compact.
- At max-width 860 map badge small hidden already; chevron maybe hidden? `.map-badge small {display:none}` at 860; map chevron can stay. Good.
- Landscape max-height 520 map modal compact: map grid maybe 2x2 still, preview 72px, body small, foot. Need add inside that media or generic max-width 560/860.
- On small portrait board card aspect ratio maybe 1.45? Sandbox bar may cover much of board. Accept.
- Ensure map foot button fits mobile. Add responsive.

Let's append to existing media blocks? Simpler append new media at end after existing ones (cascades). Use:
```
@media (max-width: 560px) {
 .map-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8}
 .map-preview-wrap{height:92px}
 .map-foot{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}
 .map-foot .primary-button{width:100%;}
